{"id":"2428c281bc3116d9","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-diagonalization-method.md","title":"Diagonalization Method Example","display":"ex-diagonalization-method — Diagonalization Method Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-diagonalization-method","aliases":["90-ex-diagonalization-method"],"display":"ex-diagonalization-method — Diagonalization Method Example","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonalization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-diagonalization-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-diagonalization-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-diagonalization-method — Diagonalization Method Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acbe50cee0754d98\" href=\"?note=acbe50cee0754d98\" title=\"90-df-diagonalization\">90-df-diagonalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (purported enumeration of unary number-theoretic functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)=F(n)(n)+1\">\\(g(n)=F(n)(n)+1\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}diagonalization\\text{-}method}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne F(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}diagonalization\\text{-}method}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne F(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(m)=F(m)(m)+1\\ne F(m)(m)\">\\(g(m)=F(m)(m)+1\\ne F(m)(m)\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的值域。</li>\n<li>原式把自然数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\">\\(f(n)\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 比较，存在类型错误；这里统一为函数枚举。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonalization","status":"resolved","id":"acbe50cee0754d98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonalization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g(n)=F(n)(n)+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}diagonalization\\text{-}method}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne F(m).","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"g(m)=F(m)(m)+1\\ne F(m)(m)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":875,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-ex-berry-paradox-formal.md]]\n[[90-ex-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-ex-diagonalization-method.md]]\n[[90-ex-godel-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-sentence.md]]\n[[90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-rus